{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d5_level_act15d5_st03","groupId":"act15d5","stageId":null,"title":"童話永存","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st03.txt","sourceHash":"8fccb07d6515b6d33e4ee48d4182cf54cad74412f33e861f81adab6ee7177ef2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為完成一個二十年前的約定，愛麗絲尋著目標人物的蹤跡展開旅行，在這途中，她偶遇了一個小小的礦石病感染者。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天就要出發了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"教母才剛把這柄杖交給你，城堡裡的東西還沒理清呢，真的有必要這麼急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"時間就要到了，不論如何，我必須按時把東西送去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，我們恪守約定，從不失信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒說這個。我只是覺得太倉促了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"你完全可以先做些簡單點的，比如挑個好孩子招待到城堡裡來，或者讓那些小夥子小姑娘做個美夢什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"總比上來就去找一個十多年前的姑娘要好。我們就知道個名字，愛麗絲你又還沒經驗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實經驗不足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的那麼多位前輩，可沒有一個因為艱難就放棄履約。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......行吧，如果你堅持的話，我攔不住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那這個鐵疙瘩，喏，你拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"這是，收音機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"淘汰款。現在估計也就勉強在小範圍裡收收電波吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_150","isRemote":false,"text":"你這樣戳，小心把它給戳散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_150","isRemote":false,"text":"來，這個給你。是路上用得著的東西，我把資料也一起放進去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我才沒那麼不小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是原樣保管的，讓別人拿著我才不放心呢，千萬別在路上碰壞了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"你想多了，這絕不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那可說不準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_150","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，別鬧了。沒人懷疑你的能力，我們都很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_150","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟是你第一次出門，大家會擔心也是正常的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_150","isRemote":false,"text":"在外面要注意安全，對陌生人要更警惕一些。載具都準備好了，記得走一段路就要好好維護零件，在進荒野之前千萬要注意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_150","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我說太多了。不管怎麼樣，優先保護好自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......我明白的。不用擔心，雖然可能很難，但這不算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定得要完成這個約定才行。我們已經太久沒有在外面活動過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子們因為信任所以將他們珍惜的東西交給我們保管，我們就一定也要如約歸還，不能讓這信任落空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣一來，就算他們長大了，已經不再相信了，我也會向他們證明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我會證明——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"童話永存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_150","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎，那祝你一切順利了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_150","isRemote":false,"text":"期待你的歸來。愛麗絲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔，終於到了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（按照記錄，當時應該是在這個地點招待孩子的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（托內爾村。那孩子的名字是叫......瑪佩爾。好，沒問題。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是這......這是村子嗎？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，小心，小小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"別往裡面走了，會弄髒你的鞋。這麼好的鞋，弄髒了多可惜，我們可賠不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝你的提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小小姐，你一看就是好人家的小姐，沒有隨從跟著你嗎？你做什麼到這種地方來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我不用隨從。我只是來找一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，這裡可是維多利亞。維多利亞人在我們自己的土地上能出什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！說得好！說得好，小小姐，我們的人在自己的家裡當然最安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，還是多注意點吧，你還太小了。唉，城裡最近有些不太平，小心行事沒有壞處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"城裡......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，算了。城裡的事與我無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經回答你了。現在該你答我的問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你要問什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來這裡找人的，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不應該是一個村莊嗎？怎麼看不到其他人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"村莊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己看看，小小姐，這哪裡看起來像是村莊了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"之前倒是有幾個村子就在這附近，但現在也走了。貴族老爺要了這塊地，今春就要動工，要建工廠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......工廠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"看這個，看這個鐵皮，還有這大傢伙！氣派吧，嗡嗡響！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"很、很酷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"但是工廠......為什麼選這裡，怎麼不建在移動地塊上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"貴族老爺愛建在哪裡就建哪裡，哪輪得著我們問這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"能告訴我之前在這裡的那些村子遷去哪裡了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？那誰知道啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"反正他們搬也搬不了太遠。這一片還算好的，離城市的軌道也近，再往荒地裡走一段，就真的只有些沒處可去的流民才會去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。謝謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（......還算在預料之中。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（已經過了快二十年，當年那個孩子所在的村子搬遷了也不奇怪......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（看來只能在周圍一點點找了。至少村子的名字，還有當年那個孩子的名字都還在記錄裡，實在不行，就進城想辦法查一查。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（哼，這麼點小問題，才不可能攔得住我！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，這裡是托內爾村嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的？好的，謝謝，打擾了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_med"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，請問有人認識一個叫瑪佩爾的女孩......嗯，不對，應該是個二十多歲的女性，有人認識她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，我會去另一邊問問看的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾一下，請問這裡是托內爾村嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"請問......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"愛麗絲想起，她的撫養人曾經說過，維護一個樂園，一個脆弱的夢，從來都不簡單。\n只是為了踐行一種承諾，為了讓夢想鄉永存於孩子們小小的心中。他們總是拼盡全力，拼上所有。\n遠離塵世的陸離夢境變作童謠裡的輕哼，碎成故事中的片語在這土地上流傳，傳了成百上千年。\n她不想放棄。\n她不能放棄。\n童話裡，從沒有做不到的事情。\n放在現實中，無非是看執行者夠不夠執著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（從這條路向南，然後轉東面......再穿過這裡的樹林......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（這裡有塊路牌，嗯，應該沒有走錯。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（這是第幾個村子了？這裡已經是移動城市的邊緣地塊了，再往內找，就要進內城了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（或者，就向外走......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了，先找個地方把載具維護一下吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？什麼聲音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，我們要回家了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的病已經好了嗎？可是我還是好痛......我們不去看醫生嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們回家......不去醫院，我們回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸買了藥來，我們回家喝了藥，朵拉就不會痛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦？又要吃好苦好苦的藥嗎......我不想吃藥！不要嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"朵拉，聽話，吃了藥病就會好了。所以不能怕苦，知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是真的好苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上次那個紙片燒的灰好難咽，上上次打針也好痛......媽媽，我能不看病了嗎？我不想打針，也不想再吃那些藥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我能出門玩嗎？我想學校裡的朋友了。莓莓前兩天又來問我什麼時候一起玩了，我想和她出去玩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（抽泣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，你哭了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽你別哭！我......我好好吃藥，我一定不出門！我再也不說了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聽爸爸媽媽的。我會做個好孩子。所以媽媽你別哭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"朵拉，朵拉......好孩子，為什麼偏偏是你，為什麼偏偏是你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可憐的女兒......哎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（得了病的孩子......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這次的任務差不多結束了，幫我蓋個章吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"順便，我從南邊帶了點水果給莓莓，這是不是她上次吵著要吃的那種？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼還帶東西，也太麻煩你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝了，就是這個。你也別太寵這小丫頭，成天吃甜的，她牙都快蛀掉了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"整天就知道玩，哎，今早還非和我說昨晚有小仙女招待她去城堡做客，我看就是給她睡前故事講多了，多大年紀了還傻乎乎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"她還小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不小了，馬上都要去上學了。我看看......任務沒問題，章就給你蓋這上頭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了，這個還你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你這次回來得還挺快。城裡現在怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"比我想的要好得多。最近咖啡館裡都在談論政治，但只是談論，集會很穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟除了那些文化人，我們普通百姓都不關心那些政治上的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"前天倒是有一批工人因為工錢太低在街頭鬧了一場，好在沒人受傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"這聽起來好像不是什麼大問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那個女孩是？不是本地人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？哦，你說她......你眼睛真尖。那姑娘是昨天突然跑到村子裡來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是來找什麼人的，先是問了村子的名字，好像是對上了，然後就開始挨家挨戶地問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"只有個名字，這人可不好找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道她之前還跑了多少路，開來的那台載具外殼都被刮得一塌糊塗了，現在還停在老伊森那裡等著修呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"這女孩可真夠執著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"大夥也想幫幫忙，莓莓這小東西今天幫忙跑了一天了，到處敲門去問，好幾個小傢伙都和她一起，熱心得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"她走過來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"請問莓莓回來了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒呢，也不知道她跑哪裡去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，怎麼樣，要找的人還沒找到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你要找的是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......你又是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"怪模怪樣，還蒙著面，可疑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哈、哈哈......她說的還真沒錯，第一次看到你的時候我也是這麼想的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......真有這麼可疑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不說謊話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小姐，別這樣皺眉。你要找什麼人，就和他說說吧，別看他打扮得不像好人，其實還是挺靠得住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這麼瞪眼，眼睛不會痛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"還行。習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。我不和你計較。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不和孩子計較。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞪眼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你少說兩句！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你已經知道我在找人，那告訴你也無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪佩爾。我在找瑪佩爾·格林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡重複。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你們怎麼又開始瞪眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我才沒有這麼幼稚呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我......其實我也沒見過那個人。但我知道，她叫做瑪佩爾，是個菲林，有棕色頭髮和綠眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"年紀大約不到三十，好像手很靈巧......我聽到的就這麼多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......村子裡的人家我每一戶都找遍了，目前為止還完全沒有線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡真的是托內爾村？難道是我弄錯了名字嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不好說啊，發音相似的村子那可太多了，小姐你又沒有明確的記錄，況且又是找那麼多年前的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你別，別難過。肯定能找到的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得村子靠樹林那裡還有幾戶人家，那邊你去過沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"大不了......大不了你和這傢伙說一聲，讓他接這個任務，幫你一起找！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，等下，羅德島的任務都是要先登記......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通辦事員","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）少打官腔，你手頭的任務不都結束了嗎！一句話，幫不幫這個忙？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）......行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼，神神秘秘的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......你跟著我幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（聳肩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"前面就出村子了，你打算去旁邊的那幾戶人家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我自己可以，這是我的工作，不用你來幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......童工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。 沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我是想說，關於你要找的人，我可能知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"——噓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，別說話！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（你有沒有......聽到什麼聲音？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不行！我不同意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怕了？！你怕了是不是？！你害怕被判刑，就要把我們的女兒交出去？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你這樣做的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不能把朵拉交出去，他們會把她帶走，把她一個人丟到隔離區去，她還那麼小，進去就再也出不來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的孩子，這是我們的孩子啊，你怎麼忍心？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你冷靜——小聲一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼會想把朵拉交出去，我從沒有這麼說！只是，只是你就忍心看她這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們治不好她......什麼藥都試過了，他們說的那些方法我們都帶她試過了......沒用，什麼用都沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們去買藥，已經有人開始懷疑了，這件事瞞不下去的！我們該早做打算！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們，我們離開這裡。我們帶著朵拉走，不在這裡過了，我們可以去沒有人的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我們又能去哪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（聲音是從這邊傳來的。嗯......這裡，就是這一戶。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（他們在說......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（應該是女兒得了礦石病。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（私藏感染者。在維多利亞，這也算是重罪了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"（朵拉......我聽過這個名字......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說風就是雨的......真是，孩子脾氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二、三......木頭人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二、三......不許動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娃娃，娃娃，如果你會動就好了，這樣就可以陪我玩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娃娃，你說，爸媽什麼時候才會答應讓我出門玩呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想生病了，生病真討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......手臂好痛......肚子也好痛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"別抓，抓破的話可能會更難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（捂嘴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）你、你是什麼人呀！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）你是怎麼進來的？窗戶應該都關上了......哎，不對，你還是快點出去吧！被我爸爸媽媽發現，我們都會挨駡的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"那種窗戶還攔不住我。沒關係，不會有人發現的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛在玩遊戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想讓這個娃娃動起來，陪你玩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然想！可是......娃娃怎麼可能會動呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"有辦法的。故事書裡小精怪不是都會說話？既然能有變成人的木偶，兩條腿走路的貓，當然也有會動的娃娃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你喜歡聽故事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喜歡！媽媽給我講過好多故事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煙囪小鬼的故事，大剪刀的故事，花園裡的小妖精的故事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有開茶會的城堡的故事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一個好大好大，好美好美，只有好孩子才能去的城堡，裡面住著善良的小妖精，會準備好吃的點心，整天都開著茶會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天上的雲伸手就能摘到，嘗起來也是甜甜的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也好想去城堡，去參加茶會呀，所以，我一直有努力做個好孩子，小妖精什麼時候才會接我去城堡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"或許很快就會有機會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"你是個好孩子，一定可以的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎，太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去了城堡，娃娃就會動起來，陪我玩了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。故事裡也說了吧，妖精的城堡會替好孩子保存他們心愛的寶物，等到了約定好的時間，寶物就會再次回到孩子的身旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"在城堡裡生活過的娃娃就不是普通的娃娃了，它會動起來，會唱歌，會陪你玩遊戲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想讓它“活”過來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我很想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，一定要和娃娃分開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一定要分開的話，那還是不了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"為、為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"不會花費多少時間的，我的朋友......不對，妖精是很厲害的，一定很快就會讓娃娃動起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"只要提前約定好，娃娃很快就會回到你身邊了呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個娃娃，是爸爸媽媽送給我的生日禮物。我不想和她分開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到娃娃的那天我就和媽媽保證過啦，我會一直保護她！自己的寶貝，當然要自己來保護，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼大家會把自己的寶物交給妖精來保存呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你生病了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦被別人發現，你就會被帶走的。如果真的被抓走，你就沒法再保護你的娃娃了呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......爸爸也是這樣說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，沒關係的，我會乖乖地待在家裡，爸爸媽媽不會讓我被抓走的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娃娃是我的寶貝，我保護娃娃。爸爸媽媽說我是他們的寶貝，爸爸媽媽會保護我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以只要我聽話當個好孩子，就不會被抓走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼想也好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。謝謝你擔心我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啦，我還沒問你的名字呢，你真的不會被爸爸媽媽發現嗎？你......不是我們村子裡的人吧，我從來沒見過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫朵拉，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫......愛麗絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛麗絲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能......能不能陪我玩一會兒？就一小會兒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人太無聊啦，不能出門玩，就只能在家裡畫畫，玩拼圖......玩了那麼久我都膩了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能出門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想出去，媽媽就會哭。因為我生了很壞的病，隨便出門的話，會被壞人抓走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被抓走了，就再也見不到爸爸媽媽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想惹媽媽哭，也不想和爸爸媽媽分開。可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好想莓莓他們，我想回去上學了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"你別難過......我、我陪你玩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"這個你喜歡嗎？還有這個玩具，按這裡就能發光的！我們先玩拼圖好嗎，下次我再幫你帶新的布偶來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，我只能做到這些......我沒辦法讓你出門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好奇怪，為什麼愛麗絲要道歉？愛麗絲沒有做錯什麼呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你說，如果真的見到妖精小姐，我可以許願嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以！妖精可是很厲害的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！城堡裡的妖精小姐能治好我的病嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"妖精小姐也不是什麼都能做到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然沒有辦法治好你的病！但是如果你還有其他什麼願望，一定都可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，我想要媽媽不再哭，也可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"這個、這個不行，還有其他的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......還想要快點長大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個也不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"全都做不到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就算啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"朵拉，你不失望嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會覺得......妖精很沒用，童話都是騙人的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你一個秘密，千萬不要說出去哦！其實，我的好朋友莓莓早上來找我玩啦，她進不來，我們隔著窗戶偷偷說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莓莓說，昨晚真的有妖精小姐邀請她去城堡了，莓莓不會騙我的，她說那裡像夢一樣好，蛋糕和小餅乾都很好吃呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"莓莓也是個好孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！不過，我要是見到妖精小姐，一定不提剛剛說的那些願望了。愛麗絲也要幫忙保密！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"保密？為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你想啊，妖精小姐如果知道自己沒法實現我的願望，那她該有多難受啊。當然不能說出去啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"終於出來了。和那個小姑娘說完話了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎麼知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我和那對父母談了談，聽到裡面屋子的動靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，不順利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你管......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"那對父母怎麼回事，他們難道真的想把女兒交出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是，他們並不想讓女兒離開身邊。他們只是......想不到其他辦法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一被其他人發現，會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那個生病了的小女孩估計會被直接帶走，丟進隔離區吧。父母包庇私藏感染者，多半也會被判刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，現在不用太擔心這個。我已經給他們介紹了一個可靠的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"對於他們這樣的情況，什麼地方才能算得上可靠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道朵拉得的是礦石病，這種很壞的病現在是治不好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"算是個什麼地方呢......嗯，有點難形容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，是個能讓他們的女兒得到治療，而不是簡單地隔離起來等死，或者直接被吊死，在廣場上被處刑的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......這聽起來倒是還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。不過，我只提供一個可能，怎麼選還看他們自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞人對他們的土地和國家有奇怪的驕傲與優越感，這我已經領教過許多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼覺得......你在諷刺？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我沒有這個意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"只是要拋棄現在的生活，去追求一個可能性，確實沒有說起來那麼簡單。就算他們最終選擇繼續留下，我也不會感到奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"那個生病了的女孩，她還相信童話，她還那麼小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫不了她......那是個好孩子，但我，什麼都沒能為她做。一個故事，一時的夢境，遠遠不夠從病痛手中解救她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"但這讓人有希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道你在煩惱的是什麼，但是我覺得故事和美夢都是好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"美好的東西總讓人嚮往，讓人產生希望。在這樣糟糕的環境裡，讓人保有一些對美好東西的憧憬是有必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟得先知道什麼是好的，我們才能有個努力的方向，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你呢。你相信童話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我信一些比故事還理想化的東西。如果那也算童話的話，那我確實相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"別多想了。我們能為他人做的本來就很少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你之前說你在找的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你已經沒有其他線索的話，我倒是知道一個叫做瑪佩爾的女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道她原本是維多利亞人，二十多歲，棕色頭髮，綠眼睛，手很靈巧不過不愛做手工，只喜歡擺弄些機械零件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"姑且......和你的敘述都對得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"——！這麼多都對得上，這不可能只是巧合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"她在哪！告訴我她在哪裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。其實我也越想越這麼覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果你要找的真的是她，現在其實已經有些遲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"char_338_iris","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情可能不該由我來告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"或許......你該試著去見見她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_338_iris","aliases":["？？？","愛麗絲"]}]}
